(3. CAPITAL EXPENDITURE \(CAPEX\) ALLOCATION AND DISCIPLINE) '
() '
(Total CapEx expenditures for the fiscal year are budgeted at $38.5) '
(million. Growth CapEx accounts for 68% of expenditures, dedicated to) '
(automated warehouse robotics, high-throughput conveyor systems, and) '
(enterprise cloud migrations.) '
() '
(Maintenance CapEx is capped at $12.3 million, strictly audited under) '
(our internal hurdle rate requirement of 15% Internal Rate of Return) '
(\(IRR\) with a maximum payback period of 36 months.) '
() '
(4. DEBT MATURITY PROFILE AND INTEREST RATE RISK MANAGEMENT) '
() '
(Our capital structure consists of $110.0 million in 5.25% senior) '
(unsecured notes maturing in 2029 and $45.0 million in term loan) '
(facilities. Currently, 85% of total outstanding debt is fixed or) '
(synthetically hedged via floating-to-fixed interest rate swaps at a) '
(blended effective cost of capital of 4.88%.) '
() '
ET

endstream
endobj
