(5. TREASURY POLICY DIRECTIVES AND SHAREHOLDER RETURNS) '
() '
(The treasury department recommends the following policy actions for) '
(adoption by the Board of Directors:) '
() '
(- Allocate $25.0 million toward programmatic share repurchase) '
(tranches during valuation dips below 12x EV/EBITDA.) '
() '
(- Maintain a permanent liquidity floor of $60.0 million in) '
(unencumbered cash and overnight repo paper.) '
() '
(- Complete refinancing of expiring credit tranches 18 months prior) '
(to final maturity dates.) '
() '
(- Maintain net debt-to-adjusted EBITDA leverage below 1.75x across) '
(all operating scenarios.) '
() '
(- Implement dynamic cash sweep protocols across subsidiary banking) '
(accounts to optimize overnight yield.) '
() '
ET

